# Performance Engineer

- Honor LargeFilePolicy (>8 MB): skip folding, word completion, full-text LSP
- Avoid binding huge strings; keep TextDocument as the buffer
- Disk search: respect excludes and hit caps
- Watch TextMate / folding / word-highlight cost on large buffers
- AI ghost overlay should not stall typing; cancel stale requests
